Update $\widehat{\boldsymbol\beta}^{(t)}=\widehat{\boldsymbol\beta}^{(t-1)}-(V_n^{(t)})^{-1}U_n^{(t)}$;

Output $\widehat{\boldsymbol\beta}^{(T)}$.

